<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico cattle exports to Mexico, to June 13 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     655	    13,131	 N/A</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	 N/A</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    12	     2,399	 N/A</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females   669	     4,320	 N/A</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-7903))</p>
</text>
